@prefix cc: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/mfact-command-center/ontology#> .
@prefix sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

cc:PeerPresence a sosa:ObservableProperty .
cc:PeerDiscovery a sosa:Observation ; sosa:observedProperty cc:PeerPresence .
cc:PeerDiscoveryReceipt a prov:Entity ; prov:wasGeneratedBy cc:PeerDiscovery .
